        <activityName xml:lang="en">District heat, at consumer, wood chips cogen 1MWth, economic allocation</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: District heat, at consumer, wood chips cogen 1MWth, economic allocation
Inventory is valid for the district heat based on heat from wood chips in cogeneration plant only. Heat loss is 11% while heat transportation. For heat from cogeneration economic allocation was used.;
UUID: 0480eca3-3749-3f2d-83d3-b75e9f44572f
Included is the infrastructure of the deliverysystem for district heat, the losses and the heat from wood at cogen 1MWth.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: average technology
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: heat efficieny based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0480eca3-3749-3f2d-83d3-b75e9f44572f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
